competitive position in the Indian health insurance industry, robust risk management practices and experienced</strong> ..."}}}, "step8web3": {"step": 8, "title": "India Ratings Affirms Care Health Insurance at 'IND A+' ...", "toolName": "WebSearch", "url": "https://www.indiaratings.co.in/pressrelease/78003", "citation_key": "step8web3", "snippet": "In terms of sourcing, there was a moderation in the share of direct channel to 8.3% of the GDP in FY25 (FY24: 12.2%) and bancassurance to 11.2% (14.7%), and a rise in the share of sourcing through individual agents to 40.9% (38.4%) and brokers to 31.8% (30.3%). CHIL\u2019s agent network scaled up to 0.362 million in FY25 (FY24: 0.28 million; FY23: 0.239 million) making it a leading player in the health insurance industry. Established Claim Processing and Underwriting Practices: CHIL has an established claim processing and underwriting practice with an inhouse claim processing team. The company had a settlement ratio of 96.7% in FY25 (FY24: 92.6%). The company\u2019s association with high-quality reinsurers also limits the risks on its book.", "raw_data": {"search_result": {"title": "India Ratings Affirms Care Health Insurance at 'IND A+' ...", "link": "https://www.indiaratings.co.in/pressrelease/78003", "snippet": "In terms of sourcing, there was a moderation in the share of direct channel to 8.3% of the GDP in FY25 (FY24: 12.2%) and bancassurance to 11.2% (14.7%), and a rise in the share of sourcing through individual agents to 40.9% (38.4%) and brokers to 31.8% (30.3%). CHIL\u2019s agent network scaled up to 0.362 million in FY25 (FY24: 0.28 million; FY23: 0.239 million) making it a leading player in the health insurance industry. Established Claim Processing and Underwriting Practices: CHIL has an established claim processing and underwriting practice with an inhouse claim processing team. The company had a settlement ratio of 96.7% in FY25 (FY24: 92.6%). The company\u2019s association with high-quality reinsurers als